e(3,'c',[5,6],8,'Construct','Construct the database in3NF for all entities shown inFigures1 and2. Incorporate VET and use the given table notation.',C,['A3.2.6','A3.2.4'],'A',7,'Separate pet,passport,vaccine,vaccination withkeys andVETlinks;valid alternatives accepted.','Construct a3NF schema for these facts. Each asset has AssetID,label andmodel,and one current certificate recording issue date and issuing technician. Each technician has TechID,name andphone. An asset can have many inspections. Each inspection has InspectionID,date,valid-until date,inspecting technician andone standard. A standard has StandardID,title andauthority. Show primary andforeign keys.',pts((1,'Separate TECH andASSET tables with their own descriptive attributes.'),(1,'Separate CERTIFICATE table for certificate-specific facts.'),(1,'Separate STANDARD table storing title andauthority once.'),(1,'Separate INSPECTION event table.'),(1,'Correct stable primary keys,including one certificate perasset.'),(1,'Correct certificate→asset andissuer→TECH foreign keys.'),(1,'Correct inspection→asset,TECH andSTANDARD foreign keys.'),(1,'Event dates belong to inspections;no repeated groups or duplicated technician/standard descriptions.')),solution=solution,assets=[pageasset('SRC-034',5,'Source passport entities'),pageasset('SRC-034',6,'Source repeated vaccination event fields')])
